flowchart LR
  accTitle: Sigma shared uncertainty representation
  accDescr: Evidence updates a shared factor-graph representation. Belief distributions inform expected utility and action selection, while action outcomes can return as learning evidence. This is a high-level teaching reconstruction rather than a copy of Sigma internals.
  E[Observations and evidence] --> F[Shared factor graph]
  F --> B[Belief distributions]
  B --> U[Expected utility]
  U --> A[Action selection]
  A --> X[Action and environment]
  X --> R[Observed outcome]
  R --> F
  R --> L[Learning signal]
  L --> F
